# Local dev-only, never commit. A Foundry install must NOT live under a dot-prefixed
# directory (e.g. `.Code`): Express's `sendFile` treats any dot-segment in an absolute
# path as a dotfile and 404s, which breaks Foundry's `/license.html` (EULA) route.
FoundryVTT-*/
# Reference copy of the paid JB2A Patreon assets — licensed content, keep it out of git.
jb2a_patreon/
# Claude Code workspace files (skills, local settings) — not part of the module.
.claude/
